  "id": "sesame-vegetable-stir-fry",
  "name": "Sesame Vegetable Stir-Fry",
  "subtitle": "Crisp vegetables with sesame and soy",
  "description": "A quick Chinese-style vegetable side combining blanched greens, aromatics, sesame oil, seeds, and soy sauce.",
